# Pairs with RoleCompilerNeverEmitsScopeless. A role may reach only ordinary data trees.
MODULE: AppsCompilerReachesReservedTree
TARGET: RoleCompilerNeverEmitsScopeless
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the role compiler admits a grant on a reserved system tree
PERTURBS: CompileRoles

--- FIND
    LET admit == o \notin ScopelessOps /\ t \in GrantableTrees
--- REPLACE
    LET admit == o \notin ScopelessOps
--- END
